  "notes": "Observed physical elements include an octagonal deck, explicit timber cupola, wooden balustrades with upright balusters, curved wooden knee braces in photos, and an adjacent separate stair. Curved knee braces remain unsupported in the current model, and a separate generic dark shelter still intersects the roof and rail.",
